WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.863
AVRASTRO CRM is the operating system for insurance

2
00:00:03.863 --> 00:00:06.962
advisors in Cyprus, in Greek and English.

3
00:00:08.062 --> 00:00:10.291
The Today screen gathers meetings,

4
00:00:10.291 --> 00:00:12.484
tasks and whatever needs attention:

5
00:00:12.787 --> 00:00:16.211
renewals coming up, applications waiting for documents.

6
00:00:16.584 --> 00:00:19.172
Every alert explains why it is there.

7
00:00:20.272 --> 00:00:22.500
The client card shows policies,

8
00:00:22.524 --> 00:00:25.414
family cover, documents and next steps.

9
00:00:25.787 --> 00:00:29.989
From there you run needs analyses, comparisons and proposals.

10
00:00:31.089 --> 00:00:34.200
Each application moves through stages, and the document

11
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.276
list shows what is missing and who you are waiting for.

12
00:00:37.649 --> 00:00:40.991
The next step goes into your diary by itself.

13
00:00:42.091 --> 00:00:44.528
Upload the client’s payslip as a PDF.

14
00:00:44.831 --> 00:00:46.606
The amounts are read on your device,

15
00:00:46.607 --> 00:00:51.204
and you see the year’s tax and the room left for deductible premiums.

16
00:00:52.304 --> 00:00:55.635
Send a summary or a document checklist by WhatsApp,

17
00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:59.153
Viber, e-mail or a PDF with your own branding.

18
00:00:59.456 --> 00:01:01.057
Nothing goes out by itself:

19
00:01:01.302 --> 00:01:02.903
you press send.

20
00:01:04.003 --> 00:01:07.765
Contact lists, campaigns with consent checks and an opportunity

21
00:01:07.765 --> 00:01:12.512
radar that explains every suggestion help your portfolio grow.

22
00:01:13.612 --> 00:01:17.605
It works offline too, on Windows, macOS and the web.

23
00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:20.182
Backups are encrypted on your device,

24
00:01:20.206 --> 00:01:23.654
and if your subscription ends your data is never deleted.

25
00:01:24.754 --> 00:01:28.898
Try it free for fourteen days, with no card, on avrastro.com.
